From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:14:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 076/342] Tracker: names wrap onto two lines in icon view, like
 the Finder

A long name took up to 30 em on one line, wider than the icon grid, so
it covered its neighbors' names. In icon view a name now wraps at a
label width (the grid's width, at least 9 em): the first line ends
between words where that keeps at least half of it, the second line is
shortened in the middle. Each line is centered under the icon and
selected on its own. The icon grid grows to fit labels of that width
and two lines, and the first column keeps its labels inside the view.

Mini icon and list view are unchanged. Renaming still uses a single
line; the second line is cleared while editing and after a rename.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
